Hello,
I have made a relatively major update to v0.72.0. There are several changes, which you may find at the NEWS.md <https://github.com/cwatson/brainGraph/commit/78fbae32b6b92a6a99fe8f63e4f2f23dc2dd67ba?short_path=8312ad0#diff-8312ad0561ef661716b48d09478362f3> file. One addition is the 'dosenbach160' atlas, which is in use with the DPARSF software (Matlab-based).

Please let me know if there are any issues. The User Manual should be updated this week.

Chris

