Hi Onur, you will have to assign that attribute to your "observed" graphs, i.e. the actual data. So something like the following:

for (i in 1:length(groups)) {
  for (j in 1:length(densities)) {
    V(g[[i]][[j]])$clo.cent <- centr_clo(g[[i]][[j]])$res
  }
}

And then in the function call, you would type 'clo.cent' for the 4th argument (or whatever name you choose to call that variable).

Chris

